       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFORMTESTAFTER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 I PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM WITH TEST AFTER
               VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
               DISPLAY "PASS: " I
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "FINAL I: " I
           STOP RUN.
